pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "#FFFFFF"
notes: |
  第七部分汇报消融实验与参数敏感性分析。
  DLR-Attn 包含两个核心超参数：聚类簇数 B 与激活块数量 k。
  由式 8.1 和式 8.2 的 KL 散度注意力近似误差定义可见，随着稀疏度提升，近似误差存在单调递增趋势。
  通过图 8.1 的帕累托前沿分析，我们系统探索了不同超参数组合的算力-精度折中边界：
  当取 k=4, B=64 时，整体架构达到最优的「甜点（Sweet Spot）」配置，在端到端提速 3.82× 的同时，仅损失 1.4% 的检索精度；
  若进一步激进地取 k=2，吞吐可达 4.55×，但检索准确率下滑至 87.6%，发生边际效用衰减。
elements:
  # Header Kicker
  - elementId: kicker
    elementType: text
    bounds: [50, 30, 600, 16]
    content:
      fontSize: 10
      bold: true
      color: "$primary"
      letterSpacing: 1.2
      text: 07 · ABLATION STUDIES & PARETO FRONTIER

  # Header Title
  - elementId: title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [50, 48, 860, 34]
    content:
      fontSize: 21
      bold: true
      color: "$fg"
      text: 聚类簇数 \( B \) 与路由 Top-\( k \) 帕累托前沿决定计算-精度均衡点

  # Top dividing line
  - elementId: div-top
    elementType: shape
    shapeName: rect
    bounds: [50, 86, 860, 1]
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$ruleColor"
  - elementId: pmatrix-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [50, 98, 440, 20]
    content:
      fontSize: 11
      bold: true
      color: "$primary"
      text: 动态稀疏路由拓扑矩阵与分布逼近误差测度

  # pmatrix Display Formula
  - elementId: formula-pmatrix
    elementType: text
    bounds: [50, 118, 440, 90]
    content:
      fontSize: 13
      align: [center, middle]
      text: |
        <p>\( R = \begin{pmatrix} 1 & 0 & \cdots & 1 \\ 0 & 1 & \cdots & 0 \\ \vdots & \vdots & \ddots & \vdots \\ 1 & 0 & \cdots & 1 \end{pmatrix} \in \{0, 1\}^{B \times B} \)</p>

  - elementId: num-81
    elementType: text
    bounds: [340, 212, 150, 18]
    content:
      fontSize: 11
      bold: true
      color: "$gray"
      align: [right, middle]
      text: (式 8.1)

  # KL Divergence Formula with Sum & Delimiters
  - elementId: formula-kl
    elementType: text
    bounds: [50, 214, 440, 85]
    content:
      fontSize: 13
      align: [center, middle]
      text: |
        <p>\( L_{\mathrm{KL}} = \frac{1}{H} \sum_{h=1}^H \left| \sum_{j=1}^N P_{i, j}^{(h)} \ln\left( \frac{P_{i, j}^{(h)}}{\hat{P}_{i, j}^{(h)} + \epsilon} \right) \right| \)</p>

  - elementId: num-82
    elementType: text
    bounds: [340, 303, 150, 18]
    content:
      fontSize: 11
      bold: true
      color: "$gray"
      align: [right, middle]
      text: (式 8.2)

  - elementId: ablat-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [50, 328, 440, 154]
    content:
      fontSize: 11.5
      lineHeight: 1.45
      color: "$fg"
      text: |
        <p><strong>参数敏感性关键结论：</strong></p>
        <p>1. <strong>候选块数 \( k \) 的主导作用：</strong>当 \( k=8 \) 时精度完全保真（99.4%），但提速比受限于 2.35×；当 \( k=4 \) 时达到理论与系统联合最优折中点；</p>
        <p>2. <strong>簇规模 \( B \) 的饱和阈值：</strong>理论推导 \( B^* \approx 64 \)；实测当 \( B > 128 \) 时，质心路由点积算力占比上升，边际加速收益递减；</p>
        <p>3. <strong>降维投影维度 \( m \) 稳定性：</strong>在 \( m \in [8, 32] \) 区间内，\( m=16 \) 兼具 99.2% 的拓扑排序一致性与最低的寄存器占用。</p>

  # Right Column: Pareto Frontier Matplotlib Chart
  - elementId: pareto-img
    elementType: image
    bounds: [535, 102, 375, 230]
    src: assets/pareto_frontier.png
    fit:
      mode: contain

  - elementId: pareto-caption
    elementType: text
    bounds: [535, 336, 375, 42]
    content:
      fontSize: 9.5
      lineHeight: 1.3
      color: "$gray"
      text: |
        <p><strong>图 8.1: NIAH 检索准确率与端到端提速比帕累托前沿</strong>。星号标注本文推荐生产级黄金配置点（\( k=4, B=64 \)），兼顾极限加速与高可用精度。</p>

  - elementId: pareto-callout
    elementType: shape
    shapeName: rect
    bounds: [535, 386, 375, 92]
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$lightGray"
    border:
      style: solid
      width: 1
      color: "$ruleColor"

  - elementId: pareto-callout-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [550, 396, 345, 72]
    content:
      fontSize: 11
      lineHeight: 1.35
      color: "$fg"
      text: |
        <p><span style="color:#009682; font-weight:bold;">● 黄金配置验证：</span>\( (k=4, B=64) \) 在 128K 序列上仅激活 12.5% 的 KV 块，换取了 3.82× 硬件实测加速，在长文献解析、代码智能体等严肃推理场景具备直接投产价值。</p>

  # Footer dividing line
  - elementId: div-bottom
    elementType: shape
    shapeName: rect
    bounds: [50, 498, 860, 1]
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$ruleColor"
  - elementId: footer-nav
    elementType: text
    bounds: [50, 506, 860, 20]
    content:
      fontSize: 10
      color: "$gray"
      text: |
        <p>面向长上下文推理的稀疏注意力机制 · 博士学位论文答辩 <span style="float:right;">§7 消融分析 ｜ 08 / 10</span></p>
